o review quickly."}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Wrap-up"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"The goal isn’t “perfect Git” — it’s fewer surprises and faster collaboration. Start simple, write down the rules, and improve them as your team grows."}]]}],"$L25"]}]
